p. placing, allowing, committing, ordering to commit, or participating in committing economic and/or sexual exploitation of children;
q. intentionally placing, allowing, involving, ordering the involvement of children in the abuse, as well as production and distribution of narcotics and/or psychotropic substances; andr. intentionally placing, allowing, involving, ordering the involvement of children in the abuse, as well as production and distribution of alcohol and other addictive substances.

